// Section Access data security — Qlik Sense Data Architect (QSDA 2024)
// Goal: Restrict each user to their permitted rows (e.g., region).
// Concepts: Section Access, Data reduction, Reduction fields (UPPERCASE), Admin vs user access, Testing safely
// Qlik load script starter. Adapt connections/paths to your environment.

Policies:
LOAD
    PolicyID,
    Region,
    Product,
    WrittenPremium,
    IncurredLoss,
    Date(PolicyDate) as PolicyDate
FROM [lib://data/policies.qvd] (qvd);

